.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated media policy
#
# Track what cannot be reproduced; ignore what rebuilds. Regenerating an image
# does not give the same image back — it gives a different one — so anything a
# later stage was built ON TOP of has to be kept, or continuity breaks. That is
# why keyframes and narration are tracked (as JPG / wav) while renders are not.
#
# See Petal Pals/ASSETS.md for what rebuilds and how.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Full-resolution masters. The tracked JPGs under keyframes/jpg and
# elements/designs-jpg are the reference copies.
**/keyframes/full/
**/keyframes/4k/
**/keyframes/rejected/
**/elements/designs/
**/plates/

# Generated video. Clips cost credits but are reproducible from the tracked
# keyframe + aligned audio; renders are pure derivations.
**/clips/
**/out/

# Rebuilds from music/make-theme.ts in seconds.
**/music/*.wav

# Raw and discarded takes. The conformed clips under vo/ are the keepers.
**/vo/raw/
**/vo/slow/
**/vo/aligned/
**/vo-tests/
**/rerolls/
**/vo-vera/
**/vo-arthur/

# Loose PNG masters at the keyframes root (the opening shots). JPGs are tracked.
**/keyframes/*.png
